  "name": "Question 2",
  "problem": "Let $x,y$ and $z$ be integers. If $z∣x$ and $x∣y,$ then{{field-1}}.",
  "worked_solution": "For any integers $x,$ $y,$ and $z,$ we have that\n\n$$\nz∣x\\,\\text{and}\\,x∣y\\,⟹\\,z∣y.\n$$",
